{"title": "Barkskin (Condition)", "pageid": 5369, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Barkskin_(Condition)", "categories": ["Has status groups", "Conditions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">  \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\"> \n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/00/Barkskin_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Barkskin_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/00/Barkskin_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Barkskin_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/00/Barkskin_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Barkskin_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Barkskin Condition Icon.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/00/Barkskin_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Barkskin_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/00/Barkskin_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <b>Barkskin</b>\n</p>\n</div>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Armour_Class\" title=\"Armour Class\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png/25px-Armour_Class_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png/38px-Armour_Class_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Armour Class\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png/25px-Armour_Class_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Armour_Class\" title=\"Armour Class\">Armour Class</a> increased to 16. </li></ul>\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-condition-type\"></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\">Properties</span></h2>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" title=\"Stack ID\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Info_Icon.png/25px-Info_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/b/b2/Info_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Stack ID\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Info_Icon.png/25px-Info_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b2/Info_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stack ID\">Stack ID</a>: <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">BARKSKIN</code> <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=%22data%2CStackId%2CBARKSKIN%22+type:status\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=%22data%2CStackId%2CBARKSKIN%22+type:status\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span>\n</p>\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Status_groups\" title=\"Status groups\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4b/Plus_Icon.png/25px-Plus_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/4b/Plus_Icon.png/38px-Plus_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/4/4b/Plus_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Status groups\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4b/Plus_Icon.png/25px-Plus_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/4b/Plus_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Status_groups\" title=\"Status groups\">Status groups</a>: <a href=\"/wiki/SG_RemoveOnRespec\" title=\"SG RemoveOnRespec\">SG_RemoveOnRespec</a></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\">Notes</span></h2>\n<ul><li>If your Armour Class is lower than 16, Barkskin changes your base Armour Class to 16 with no other bonuses allowed from any source.</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mage_Armour_(Condition)\" title=\"Mage Armour (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/05/Mage_Armour_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Mage_Armour_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/05/Mage_Armour_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Mage_Armour_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/05/Mage_Armour_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Mage_Armour_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Mage Armour\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/05/Mage_Armour_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Mage_Armour_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/05/Mage_Armour_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Mage_Armour_(Condition)\" title=\"Mage Armour (Condition)\">Mage Armour</a>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Draconic_Resilience\" title=\"Draconic Resilience\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3d/Draconic_Resilience_Icon.webp/25px-Draconic_Resilience_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3d/Draconic_Resilience_Icon.webp/38px-Draconic_Resilience_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3d/Draconic_Resilience_Icon.webp/50px-Draconic_Resilience_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Draconic Resilience\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3d/Draconic_Resilience_Icon.webp/25px-Draconic_Resilience_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3d/Draconic_Resilience_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Draconic_Resilience\" title=\"Draconic Resilience\">Draconic Resilience</a>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Unarmoured_Defence_(Barbarian)\" title=\"Unarmoured Defence (Barbarian)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/27/Unarmoured_Defence_Barbarian_Icon.webp/25px-Unarmoured_Defence_Barbarian_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/27/Unarmoured_Defence_Barbarian_Icon.webp/38px-Unarmoured_Defence_Barbarian_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/27/Unarmoured_Defence_Barbarian_Icon.webp/50px-Unarmoured_Defence_Barbarian_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Unarmoured Defence (Barbarian)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/27/Unarmoured_Defence_Barbarian_Icon.webp/25px-Unarmoured_Defence_Barbarian_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/27/Unarmoured_Defence_Barbarian_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Unarmoured_Defence_(Barbarian)\" title=\"Unarmoured Defence (Barbarian)\">Unarmoured Defence (Barbarian)</a>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Unarmoured_Defence_(Monk)\" title=\"Unarmoured Defence (Monk)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7c/Unarmoured_Defence_Monk_Icon.webp/25px-Unarmoured_Defence_Monk_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7c/Unarmoured_Defence_Monk_Icon.webp/38px-Unarmoured_Defence_Monk_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7c/Unarmoured_Defence_Monk_Icon.webp/50px-Unarmoured_Defence_Monk_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Unarmoured Defence (Monk)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7c/Unarmoured_Defence_Monk_Icon.webp/25px-Unarmoured_Defence_Monk_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7c/Unarmoured_Defence_Monk_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Unarmoured_Defence_(Monk)\" title=\"Unarmoured Defence (Monk)\">Unarmoured Defence (Monk)</a> and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Barkskin_(Condition)\" title=\"Barkskin (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/00/Barkskin_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Barkskin_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/00/Barkskin_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Barkskin_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/00/Barkskin_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Barkskin_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Barkskin\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/00/Barkskin_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Barkskin_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/00/Barkskin_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Barkskin</a> all change your base armour class and therefore do not stack.\n<ul><li>If you have multiple of these you will only get the benefit of the one that gives the most <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Armour_Class\" title=\"Armour Class\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png/25px-Armour_Class_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png/38px-Armour_Class_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Armour Class\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png/25px-Armour_Class_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Armour_Class\" title=\"Armour Class\">Armour Class</a>.</li></ul></li>\n<li>Barkskin can work while in <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Wild_Shape\" title=\"Wild Shape\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Wild_Shape_Icon.webp/25px-Wild_Shape_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Wild_Shape_Icon.webp/38px-Wild_Shape_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Wild_Shape_Icon.webp/50px-Wild_Shape_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Wild Shape\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Wild_Shape_Icon.webp/25px-Wild_Shape_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b9/Wild_Shape_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Wild_Shape\" title=\"Wild Shape\">Wild Shape</a>.\n<ul><li>This effect only works on forms with an <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Armour_Class\" title=\"Armour Class\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png/25px-Armour_Class_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png/38px-Armour_Class_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Armour Class\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png/25px-Armour_Class_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Armour_Class\" title=\"Armour Class\">Armour Class</a> of less than 16.</li></ul></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Sources_of_Barkskin\">Sources of Barkskin</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition-sources\"><ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 5px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Barkskin\" title=\"Barkskin\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8b/Barkskin_Icon.webp/30px-Barkskin_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8b/Barkskin_Icon.webp/45px-Barkskin_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8b/Barkskin_Icon.webp/60px-Barkskin_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Barkskin\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8b/Barkskin_Icon.webp/30px-Barkskin_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8b/Barkskin_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Barkskin\" title=\"Barkskin\">Barkskin</a></span></li>\n</ul></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Creatures_with_Barkskin\">Creatures with Barkskin</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition-sources\"><ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bitey_Buddy\" title=\"Bitey Buddy\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/ce/Portrait_Bitey_Buddy.png/30px-Portrait_Bitey_Buddy.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/ce/Portrait_Bitey_Buddy.png/45px-Portrait_Bitey_Buddy.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/ce/Portrait_Bitey_Buddy.png/60px-Portrait_Bitey_Buddy.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bitey Buddy\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/ce/Portrait_Bitey_Buddy.png/30px-Portrait_Bitey_Buddy.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/ce/Portrait_Bitey_Buddy.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Bitey_Buddy\" title=\"Bitey Buddy\">Bitey Buddy</a></li>\n</ul></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP li